msgid "AVT CM41/CM62 3-Axis Gimbal/Cameras"
msgstr "AVT CM41/CM62 三轴云台/相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:7 8137667cbab04fbe8db6a5ff4086d41e
#: a947f4f66f7d49dc885069c6921cc177 cd9f9c862777473b9dd2eac313243aff
#: f925985f453a48ee99af212fdbd743c2
msgid ""
"AVT CM41/CM62 3-Axis Gimbal/Cameras can communicate with the autopilot using"
" the MAVLink Gimbal V2 protocol and are compatible with a range of cameras "
"for real-time video or mapping purposes, and on-gimbal automated object "
"recognition."
msgstr ""
"AVT CM41/CM62 三轴云台/相机可使用 MAVLink Gimbal V2 "
"协议与飞控通信，兼容多种相机以用于实时视频或测绘用途，并支持云台端的自动目标识别。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:13 07d8f4132d7e4abdaf59b2d9ceb94d0d
