"These gimbals can be purchased from the `AVT Australia store "
"<https://www.ascentvision.com.au/>`__"
msgstr "这些云台可从 `AVT Australia 商店 <https://www.ascentvision.com.au/>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:18 4218b6581dc44b72bc26535bdd41e9f6
