msgstr "将 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE <CAM1_TYPE>` 设为 \"6\"（MAVLink），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:25 1fde204120f640d484513ca63f5887d6
#: 4650dea1a98c4e9283836d291397acf2 bfa5db0b7960497abc38dad377dd77e3
#: d709c3a3ce124c198478e624bd65d9e8
msgid ""
"set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` to \"115\" for 115200 bps.  "
"\"SERIAL2\" can be replaced with any other serial port"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` 设为 \"115\"，即 115200 bps。\"SERIAL2\" "
"可替换为其他任意串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:26 6e559abd231f4333bdbc9bfe56c00564
