":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to 1024 for \"Don't forward mavlink"
" to/from\""
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS <SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 1024（「不转发 MAVLink 至/自」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:29 0bfaab4480cd4b0c991f652a308d0480
#: a45f9243b20d4f2f9fc01d4984cef166 a67c30e4ff0f4fd792260aea45f9bde0
#: bec5fcca1f74435e95564ce383d8d04f
msgid ""
"See the \"Control with an RC transmitter\" section of :ref:`this page "
"<common-mount-targeting>` for details on parameter changes required to "
"control the gimbal through an RC Transmitter (aka \"RC Targeting\")"
msgstr ""
"参见 :ref:`此页面 <common-mount-targeting>` 的「通过RC遥控器控制」部分，了解通过RC遥控器（即「RC "
"Targeting」）控制云台所需的参数更改详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:32 35e39ebb940241308f179af2f4767200
#: 4282024d2fe845698e01cae6245612bb 51749384e1ff469293b4c9ffc5377791
#: f8299c6cb6534bd8aad0370a99a34144
msgid "Control and Testing"
msgstr "控制与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:34 0369c75d81e94272ab0b08f978715bb3
