#: e554e07337304ae5819a3b6fd272ab89
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` for details on "
"how to control the gimbal using RC, GCS or Auto mode mission commands"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>`，了解如何通过 RC、GCS 或 "
"Auto 模式任务命令控制云台的详细信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avt-gimbal.rst:37 5b35e87bdb2f48a295bccb196006ed9e
